---
import { base } from 'astro:config/client';
---
<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="top">
      <div>
        <img class="footer-lockup" src={`${base}/nebu-lockup-white.svg`} alt="NEBU by CitySphere" loading="lazy" />
        <p style="max-width: 38ch; margin: 0;">
          CitySphere creates smart cities that improve how people live, move, work, and grow.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h4>Explore</h4>
        <p style="margin: 0;">
          <a href="#nebu">NEBU by CitySphere</a><br />
          <a href="#problem">The real problem</a><br />
          <a href="#systems">City systems</a><br />
          <a href="#roadmap">Delivery roadmap</a><br />
          <a href="#reliability">Reliability &amp; trust</a><br />
          <a href="#sustainability">Sustainability</a>
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h4>Contact</h4>
        <p style="margin: 0;">
          CitySphere<br />
          <a href="mailto:hello@citysphere.example">hello@citysphere.example</a><br />
          Egypt
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="credit">
      Prepared by the NEBU project team — <strong>Eslam Tarek Nabawy</strong>,
      <strong>Mohammed Tarek Omran</strong>, <strong>Nada Ahmed Samir</strong>, and
      <strong>Rahma Tarek</strong> — under the supervision of <strong>Dr. Ghada</strong>.
    </div>
    <div class="credit-note">
      NEBU is delivered as a controlled pilot; formal city approval is pending. Figures shown are
      planned, not committed.
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
